WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.600
I am the Glass Guardian.
I protect this sacred sanctuary.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.600
The light of this world is fading...

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.550
but hope will not be lost.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.650
I will catch you all!

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.950
The melody is restored.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.650
Let there be light!
